{20}{Latveria extend far in all directions and is surrounded by water.  The great city lies just to the north of here, and Lord Doom rules with fairness and mercy.}{Latveria extend far in all directions and is surrounded by water.  The great city lies just to the north of here, and Lord Doom rules with fairness and mercy.}{}{}{}{}
