{30}{Here on the farm we all do a variety of tasks.  We grow corn and wheat, we have a barn for cows and sheep and a pen for chickens.  We also harvest wood from the nearby trees and stock supplies for town in our cellar.  You could say we are the backbone of Latveria - without us it couldn't function.}{Here on the farm we all do a variety of tasks.  We grow corn and wheat, we have a barn for cows and sheep and a pen for chickens.  We also harvest wood from the nearby trees and stock supplies for town in our cellar.  You could say we are the backbone of Latveria - without us it couldn't function.}{}{}{}{}
{31}{Impressive.  It sounds like you have your hands full!}{}{5}{}{60}{}
{32}{That doesn't sound all that tough.  Milk a few cows and cut down a few trees.  Big deal.}{}{5}{}{70}{}
{39}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{40}{Lord Doom is the master of Latveria and our Savior!  He slayed the fearsome dragon of the north, Fin Fang Foom, and brought us peace!  He makes sure we are safe and that we want for nothing.}{Lord Doom is the master of Latveria and our Savior!  He slayed the fearsome dragon of the north, Fin Fang Foom, and brought us peace!  He makes sure we are safe and that we want for nothing.}{}{}{}{}
{49}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{50}{There is no need for us to go anywhere.  Latveria is self sufficient.  We rarely have anyone enter the borders of our land.  Come to think of it, you're the first new person I've seen in a very long time.}{There is no need for us to go anywhere.  Latveria is self sufficient.  We rarely have anyone enter the borders of our land.  Come to think of it, you're the first new person I've seen in a very long time.}{}{}{}{}
{59}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{60}{Yes, sir!  Indeed we do.  But we don't complain - Lord Doom treats us well and it is our honor to provide for all of Latveria!}{Yes, ma'am!  Indeed we do.  But we don't complain - Lord Doom treats us well and it is our honor to provide for all of Latveria!}{}{}{}{}
